<h1>API</h1>
<p class="dim">Read status and control the backup from outside the browser. It runs on this
port at <code>/api/v1/status</code> and takes a key instead of the web login.</p>

<div class="panel">
  <div class="row">
    <span><strong>Status:</strong> <span id="state" class="state off">off</span></span>
    <label class="switch" title="Turn the API off without revoking anything. Every path answers 404 until it is on again, and the keys keep working the moment it is."><input type="checkbox" id="switch" disabled> <span>API enabled</span></label>
  </div>
  <p class="dim" id="state-note" style="margin:8px 0 0">No keys, no API. Every path answers 404 until you
  make one. Revoke the last key and it switches off again.</p>
</div>

