# auth_request as the dashboard. That matters more here than anywhere else in
# the monitor: this page is a list of paths on the user's own share, and a list
# of paths is the one thing that must never be readable without the web login.
# It began as the Skipped Files page and now leads with everything the client
# has to say about itself: warnings, a pause, a first backup running or just
# finished, and then the skipped list under it. One place to look when the
# monitor shows a red band.
