  /* Bar on the left, details to its right, one row per file. This mirrors the
     terminal monitor, which draws the bar at a fixed column width and then the
     percentage, size and name immediately to its right on the same line
     (bb-monitor: draw_bar at x=2, text at x=2+bw). The two are the same tool
